When I was playing the other day, I had a pet baby orange dragon called
Puff (isn't that original!)  Anyway, we were in a ring shop, and Puff was
busy killing the shopkeeper --- Puff had already killed another shop
keeper two levels up.  I though to myself, gosh, I'll help Puff kill the
shop keeper.  Unfortunately, the shopkeeper concentrated his attack on
me and reduced my hit points from 60 to 10.  Taking a quick look at my
inventory I decided I had two options to stay alive:  (1) polymorph the
shopkeeper, or (2) read a scroll of taming and hope he becomes my pet.
I didn't want to risk doing (2) and being killed, so I did (1) and
survived.

Question:  Will a scroll of taming tame a shopkeeper?

